docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1135",project,The same divergence class filed upstream
close_reason: fixed
body: "The number finding matters more than its severity label suggests. This package exists to be byte-identical with the published CLI, and a hash divergence does not surface as a wrong number, it surfaces as history_drift on someone else's machine days later. It is the same failure class as two CLI versions hashing identically-declared records differently, filed upstream as pm-cli issue 1135."
